/T (A Bluetooth Serial Terminal application \(e.g., Serial Bluetooth Terminal by Kai Morich, available on the Google Play Store\) is used on an Android smartphone to pair with the HC-05 module and transmit single-character commands. Custom buttons can be configured in the app to send predefined command strings, providing a convenient control interface without requiring custom app development.)
/E (A Bluetooth Serial Terminal application \(e.g., Serial Bluetooth Terminal by Kai Morich, available on the Google Play Store\) is used on an Android smartphone to pair with the HC-05 module and transmit single-character commands. Custom buttons can be configured in the app to send predefined command strings, providing a convenient control interface without requiring custom app development.)
