/Title (The PCA9685 proved essential for generating stable, simultaneous PWM signals to all channels without burdening the Arduino's processor. The buck converter ensured that the high-current servo loads did not affect microcontroller stability. The Arduino sketch demonstrated efficient command parsing and servo control within the constraints of a single-threaded embedded environment.)
