<<
/Title (operated wirelessly via Bluetooth from an Android device, providing flexible and intuitive control of six servo joints and a gripper without any physical connection between the controller and the arm.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1415 0 R
/Prev 1436 0 R
/Next 1423 0 R
>>
endobj
1430 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Bluetooth Controlled Servo Gripper Arm comprises the following major subsystems: a mechanical arm structure with six servo joints and a gripper; an electronic control unit based on Arduino UNO and PCA9685; a wireless interface using the HC-05 Bluetooth module; and a regulated power supply built around a buck converter. Commands are sent from an Android app \(e.g., Bluetooth Serial Terminal\) to the HC-05 module, decoded by the Arduino, and translated into PWM signals dispatched through the PCA9685 to the appropriate servo motor.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1424 0 R
>>
endobj
