<<
/Title (The end-effector is a two-finger parallel gripper driven by a single SG90 micro servo. A rack-and-pinion or lever-linkage mechanism converts the servo's rotational output into the linear opening/closing motion of the fingers. The gripper can handle objects up to approximately 60 mm in diameter and exert a gripping force sufficient for lightweight pick-and-place tasks.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1425 0 R
/First 1441 0 R
/Last 1442 0 R
/Count -2
>>
endobj
